This work is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. To view a copy of this license, visit https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/untilted/6adfba9be5dee.png" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://untilted.some.pics"&gt;@untilted&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:39:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>热爱不必变成生意</title><link>https://some.pics/6adfae5914db7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术不必变成一门生意。如果你喜欢缝制护身符小袋，你可以只为自己做下去。挑选布料并把它们缝在一起的乐趣，本身就是继续做下去的好理由。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose storybook scene of a witch choosing pouch fabric inside a giant clock, with scissors, thread, hanging charm pouches, and winged deer beyond a round window. Ivory serif lettering fills the upper casing, and a gold emblem watermark sits at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft doesn't have to become a business. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6adfae5914db7.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:47:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我敢打赌他脑子里在想梗图。女人：我敢打赌他脑子里在想别的女人。男人：如果我不能只点个赞，我该怎么回应帖子下的感谢留言？要是我无视它们，我会显得傲慢；可我也不能写100遍“不客气”，那会显得不真诚，再说了——</title><link>https://some.pics/6adf9ca5262b7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我敢打赌他脑子里在想梗图。女人：我敢打赌他脑子里在想别的女人。男人：如果我不能只点个赞，我该怎么回应帖子下的感谢留言？要是我无视它们，我会显得傲慢；可我也不能写100遍“不客气”，那会显得不真诚，再说了——&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="I bet he's thinking meme. Woman: I bet he's thinking of other women. Man: how do I react to thank you messages on posts if I can't just press like, if I ignore them I will seem arrogant but also I can't write you're welcome 100 times, it will seem insincere, and furthermore-" height="483" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bookmonster/6adf9ca5262b7.png" width="854"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bookmonster.some.pics"&gt;@bookmonster&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:32:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>松动的螺丝投下阴影</title><link>https://some.pics/6adf9bbbe1e6c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;……是那颗松动的螺丝投下了阴影……&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A bird’s-eye view of planks arranged in a semicircle and fixed to a base. A screw protrudes from one of the planks, though this can only be spotted because it casts a very small shadow. " height="2236" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6adf9bbbe1e6c.jpg" width="2795"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:28:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>释放旧日冲突重负的绳结法术
https://mizjeannie.com/spells-workings/knot-spell-for-releasing-the-weight-of-an-old-conflict</title><link>https://some.pics/6adf7288da0f7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;释放旧日冲突重负的绳结法术
https://mizjeannie.com/spells-workings/knot-spell-for-releasing-the-weight-of-an-old-conflict&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait black-and-muted-pink fantasy woodland spell card with readable cream text, decorative leafy borders, all approved components, six steps, spoken words, closing, and use/caution text. A cord-tied paper packet, flowering sprig, pencil, and botanical book illustrate the working. The gold watermark at bottom right matches the second reference image." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6adf7288da0f7.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:32:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>戴上React防毒面具</title><link>https://some.pics/6adf428f47de6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;戴上 React 防毒面具。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="From out the window of a train, a small sign reads “end of CSS territory.”" height="3021" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dcr/6adf428f47de6.jpg" width="3021"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dcr.some.pics"&gt;@dcr&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:07:47 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>